{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "b722651ece8aafe25cfef2b0d801016def0630999be65b7120db781aecd8c34f", "ja": "こけら落とし公演から数日後……", "zh": "首场公演几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1002_403sor", "source_sha256": "8d05a595317322eb3c4719b0c9357e909be6b60cc64261e8bd00a376bbe2213e", "ja": "それでは最後に笑顔で！\nいきますよー！", "zh": "那么最后，笑起来！要开始咯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1003_se", "source_sha256": "ec454f2df85512c6b256bd77e40478efb7499dfeea19f2452596b4ee8e6c0af6", "ja": "パシャパシャ！！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1004_403sor", "source_sha256": "3f7b274fb7a4c536445437bf37d94e226a92484e6c9d33b8a1a35c9846ccef01", "ja": "撮影は以上になります！\nみなさん、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "拍摄到此结束！\n谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "df7614ceaf9423d0fefcffcf379a5d18764439b52ad9b9421435bb246cc70b82", "ja": "ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9", "ja": "ありがとうございました！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "04476b368ef785a1263881b582d1caa48bb5fc1b66db0df23101092d4606fc51", "ja": "ありがとうございました～♪", "zh": "非常感谢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cded9e5bb89981c91f6644e1c616cfb2b4a06fc6ad35fea350649630ad597bd9", "ja": "ありがとうございました。", "zh": "非常谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "7095704acd98664f453635bce5301319c7e5ddb0aa3e4e871be38d117a154e75", "ja": "ありがとうございました♪", "zh": "非常感谢大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "e8d82f180a759f0082b9c2729812a1ee5c28cb39fd7fb4123d9be2f9ece2061c", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま～。\n最後の表情、とっても素敵だったよ！", "zh": "大家辛苦啦～。\n最后的表情非常棒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1011_403sor", "source_sha256": "597adc7d0df8ef0fe7cd7a2173a870c528dbcea144bd363a354f210d118f38de", "ja": "ですね！　これ雑誌の表紙でも街頭モニターでも、\nどこでも立派に飾れますよ♪", "zh": "没错！这个无论登上杂志封面，还是街头大屏幕，都绝对够格呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "136de4c72cb9f058ea50a63faba593658d38ed588b33723ded7310d76aecbb0d", "ja": "いつも助かります、早坂さん。\nみんなも、あらためてお疲れさま！", "zh": "一直以来都帮了大忙，早坂小姐。\n大家也是，再次辛苦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "1aeb425af3c87fb8ee3d97ee746ede58cc553669840d26742ec89dd971f38338", "ja": "今の撮影でひとまず、\nこけら落とし関係の仕事は一段落かな。", "zh": "拍完现在这组照片，和开幕公演有关的工作暂时就告一段落了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "000647679eaf503a48f8f984f8f01b2462865e4da5bca44d408c5b9ca6fa3631", "ja": "一段落ですか……。でも、この衣装に袖を通すだけで、\nすぐあの日の気持ちに戻ってしまいますね。", "zh": "告一段落了吗……不过，只要穿上这身服装，就会立刻回想起那天的心情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "aab1f3e6e4b7f5ccc569a1ea22f306224d5dc125194c220213800729ffbc9a4a", "ja": "ええ、本当に。\nきっと一生忘れることはないと思う。", "zh": "嗯，真的。\n我想这一辈子都不会忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "2cc2772500bcb4e39eaec4be281eda59eb1c8799ade7cc1e181bea9696f9f443", "ja": "そうなんです！　私も、あんなに素敵なステージの\nお手伝いをさせてもらえて、忘れられなくて！", "zh": "就是这样！我也有幸参与了那么精彩的舞台，实在难以忘怀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "6bb3cd4181a01d48336d6f0c5a0d960cddfb19a33dce61e7bdf3b9efc853ff23", "ja": "今でも思い出すだけで、なんだか……\n目が潤んできちゃって……ぐすっ！", "zh": "现在只要一回想起来，就总觉得……眼泪都要涌出来了……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1018_403sor", "source_sha256": "1037bedd4cf41f0a97a9de493eb6c40e42cdcc8bb6b99e71eac28b530d6b5f70", "ja": "わかります！　私も、ファインダー越しに捉えていた\nみなさんの絆を思い出すと、今でも……ぐすっ！", "zh": "我明白！我一想起透过取景器捕捉到的\n大家之间的羁绊，直到现在也还是……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "c3ade433ed19d0e2bd6394bedeed87b21a095b881958f0c89e8078dfa479322a", "ja": "あ、青羽さん、早坂さんも、やめてくださいよ……。\nそんなこと言われると、俺まで……ぐすっ！", "zh": "啊，青羽小姐、早坂小姐，也请你们别说了……你们这么一说，连我都……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5ce76b3bbdae88d6ae3f42775ff9540ef31f7f623bccdd220332588430e6d380", "ja": "また泣いてる～。なんか大人の人って意外と泣くよね。\n公演の後も、わたし達よりずっと泣いてたもん。", "zh": "又哭啦～。感觉大人们意外地很爱哭呢。\n公演结束之后，明明也哭得比我们凶得多嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "b8d6ec360bf8617bd90977b9e1a78ece1d6d4ea8510eed390a32d34b60621aed", "ja": "そうそう、うちのお父さんも、なんか泣いてたんだー。\nあ、でもお母さんは笑ってたよ？", "zh": "对对，我爸爸也不知道为什么在哭呢——\n啊，不过我妈妈是在笑哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "04de7b4777caa51bd7f75cac16b85e6a9615d3c6882e225b6f2a436056623d34", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだか未来のおうちっぽい。", "zh": "呵呵，感觉有点像未来的家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb12d9da274dcd58a0ef089cf694ec753887099a9720a4beeda3f50a68536500", "ja": "あ、静香ちゃんのお父さんは？", "zh": "啊，静香的爸爸呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "28f5a4f3a850b3118759404e8b2d334f2ffd09b2173548559e1b711c316e5778", "ja": "あ、もしかして泣いてた？　ほめてくれた？？", "zh": "啊，难道你刚才哭了吗？夸我了吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "796a8a77ad78e53ab6ee29909105f86d74279efa17dca930bc4b77e67478e191", "ja": "そ、それは……。な、内緒。", "zh": "那、那是……保、保密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "7cbaaca2556be1e8d6ce0601417bca224dcbda403b00d3dddcb697d38c3b68d6", "ja": "え～～～！　ずるい～～～！", "zh": "诶～～～！好狡猾～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7cbaaca2556be1e8d6ce0601417bca224dcbda403b00d3dddcb697d38c3b68d6", "ja": "え～～～！　ずるい～～～！", "zh": "诶～～～！好狡猾～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "693c8d5ae9c0bd90abf068316a3732be1185926259ada9029e9e2e28c5ab73e9", "ja": "こらこら、そういうことは聞くもんじゃないぞ。\nそれに……そうだな、今までの話はもういいか。", "zh": "好啦好啦，这种事可不能问啊。\n而且……对了，之前的话题就先到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "81369aac8a2b4356de40f02a5eb39131b8e00ad8bf8e103097af32d82f2ce5cd", "ja": "それより！\nみんなには、次の話があるんだ！", "zh": "比起这个！\n我有件事要告诉大家，关于接下来的安排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "cdffc1615f0e8570457b8a1c8d8f20c9d66d3b3a38a4f54c71d96a2c2e2edd5c", "ja": "？　次の、ですか？", "zh": "？　下一个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "d5f481eb7201f0d9873a33ec4b35fd5aacefcd85728f662ea5bcd1ee2daa0842", "ja": "ああ、こけら落とし公演はゴールじゃなくてスタート。\nこの劇場は、とうとう動き出したんだ。", "zh": "是啊，首场演出不是终点，而是起点。\n这座剧场终于开始运转了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "79b0672fd45a3a4c42a1d91b77a26e77e7a51515ccbe55d763c10efd400a1e4f", "ja": "だからすぐに、次の準備をする必要がある。\n……第1回、定期公演に向けて！", "zh": "所以，必须马上开始准备下一场。\n……为了第1次定期公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "19edbeb574fc652ad0ba17657d7f03e8733a1d5e5e631b94fa60f5efcc3b89c1", "ja": "定期公演……！", "zh": "定期公演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1034_102mis", "source_sha256": "ea660d77412af1da542174b1f2d6d2bb147a86d1b07ff250ac84d3de92b02203", "ja": "そうですよね！\n本当に、これからが本番です♪", "zh": "就是这样！\n真正的考验，从现在才开始♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1035_403sor", "source_sha256": "a33c634965aca99ddcf25819871044bde471f3079593e1544db27631dca9e421", "ja": "この劇場の目的、『765プロのアイドルによる\n定期的な公演』ってやつですね？", "zh": "这个剧场的目的，就是『由765事务所的偶像定期举办公演』，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1036_401pro", "source_sha256": "1a3bbbc6d02a2c58d7354fd4fa1d091612002e4fbe4a17f5c79bc5e625a5001d", "ja": "はい。まずはチームごとに日替わりで、色んな曲を\n毎日違うメンバーで、届けていこうと思ってます。", "zh": "是的。首先，我打算让各个团队轮流每天演出，用每天不同的成员，\n为大家带来各种各样的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1037_401pro", "source_sha256": "900559c4d4c431cb100e15a17f9be32b9746a1e68a1cec68b559a93d9f081ee4", "ja": "というわけで、初日メンバーは……\nTeam8th、君達に任せたい！", "zh": "所以，首日成员就……拜托Team8th的各位了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8feeb023e1f0b3309a0207993f87ae7e9569fb564026e45692334d8210050f34", "ja": "！　わたし達が初日！？", "zh": "！我们是首日成员！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "647686b60beadcfdeb5143fc428311d95910e1e3d30d07c40287786c2f2a081d", "ja": "チームのデビューとは、逆なんですね？", "zh": "和团队出道的顺序相反呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1040_401pro", "source_sha256": "653b0a846ac3445613e639adab172fc53a6df6573c4cf166af4f33e2c7c19e35", "ja": "あ、全部逆順でやるつもりはないんですけど……。\n最初はこの5人がいいかなって、なんとなく。", "zh": "啊，我没打算全部按逆序来……只是隐约觉得，最开始先选这5个人比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1041_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9cd4c5966625e6947eab63f3f0d5c705e696d81a9f9b88bbab09b3f9c1c3749d", "ja": "！　あ、貴方という人は、大事な初日メンバーを、\nなんとなく決めたのですか！？", "zh": "！你这个人啊，竟然把重要的首日成员就这么凭感觉决定了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "7d46d41b30ba7ef39cfb3e311b3e3d4f5f6fc891952fef5de07445f5de2c6928", "ja": "い、いやっ、いろいろ考えたよ！\n統一感とかテーマ性とか、考えたんだけど……。", "zh": "不、不是的，我也考虑了很多啊！\n比如统一感或者主题性之类的，虽然也考虑过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1043_401pro", "source_sha256": "f20077e8582c1c30c529d03efd64bd8feeda2edc6aaecd8f1b9dbc5e8f9ff1d0", "ja": "こけら落とし公演を見て……思ったんだ。\nTeam8thから……このメンバーから始めたいって。", "zh": "看完开幕公演……我就想，从Team8th……从这几位成员开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1044_401pro", "source_sha256": "68cf2fdf151a477009a13953a498b4528b23346ab5916a1e55865e3612b4d995", "ja": "だから、ごめん。確かに最終的には、\n俺の直感でしかないのかもしれない。", "zh": "所以，抱歉。确实，到最后或许也只是凭我的直觉罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1045_051tmg", "source_sha256": "af5b5a363eab343301965da6cb6c1a711254ab4cf75cf21fedaae82286c5c956", "ja": "……。それはそれで、\nプレッシャーになるのですが……。", "zh": "……这样一来，反而让我有压力了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1046_052kao", "source_sha256": "ed46ed3792884c2d2bceb9297ba6572315c8b36ab3271c7ec2498cc82f9abd82", "ja": "……でも、光栄です。\nまたみんなで、一緒に頑張りましょうね！", "zh": "……不过，这也很荣幸呢。\n大家之后再一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3207f5f4534a22efb6affcd5b3a4f334c520ba365cd5e111b3357076b0a6d5e", "ja": "はーい！　歌織さんが教えてくれるなら、\nレッスンも頑張れると思いまーす♪", "zh": "好——！要是歌织姐愿意教我的话，我想我连训练也能努力坚持下去——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "f648023e9c4a2ead54aa5308223f6ba983b97d23ef0ee2221485194b5e141a19", "ja": "もう、教えてくれなくても頑張るのっ。\n……でも歌織さん、よかったらお願いします！", "zh": "真是的，就算没人教也要努力才行啦。\n……不过歌织小姐，如果不介意的话就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1049_052kao", "source_sha256": "7db2ad56408b0521804a851b597c110acab029fa9362a03b2cbba35f90eab763", "ja": "ええ、私に教えられる事なら何でも。\nこれからが、アイドルの本番だものね。", "zh": "嗯，只要是我能教的，我什么都愿意教。\n接下来才是偶像真正的舞台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1050_014mir", "source_sha256": "dc3072d259faf01b0ee089a14f03b50877d80ff98bbf69641765f21a0055a85c", "ja": "アイドルの、本番……。", "zh": "偶像的……正戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1051_014mir", "source_sha256": "714131059c69d20000218cf8a8ad2bd5efb666357f34a21f393bd81b9b8ae96a", "ja": "そっか……始まるんだ。\n私達の……アイドルの、これから……！", "zh": "这样啊……要开始了。我们的……偶像之路的未来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_intro_1052_401pro", "source_sha256": "20e5da75bda96320b014c9b93c88c74e665f6d904c4c464a61a55ffd1b3ca56d", "ja": "うん！　みんなの……。\nこの劇場の、これからを始めよう！", "zh": "嗯！让我们开启大家的……以及这座剧场的未来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
